WEBVTT

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:04.260
A 256-way classifier with no encoders.

00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:08.656
Read against its own artifacts rather than its announcement.

00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:17.684
256 classes in a Linear(3840, 256) head: the option count, welded into trained weights.

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:22.809
The card's median latency, on an H200.

00:00:22.809 --> 00:00:29.109
Text, about 2k tokens, 83 ms; video, sixteen frames, 504 ms.

00:00:29.109 --> 00:00:33.117
The claim that travelled: under 100 ms.

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:38.447
DecisionBench Medium, the author's own benchmark.

00:00:38.447 --> 00:00:41.379
Jev-Omni, 87.57%; Jev, 90.48%.

00:00:41.379 --> 00:00:45.776
Three ordinary chat models score 99.

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:49.982
The multimodal claim is true and smaller than it sounds.

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:57.358
Every number here is from the full article, with its sources, at ai.thesatyajit.com.
